WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.337
Open Slide Deck to choose its format and length.

00:00:01.337 --> 00:00:04.318
Choose short presenter slides and provide a focused brief.

00:00:04.318 --> 00:00:06.808
Open the generated presentation and review its sequence.

00:00:06.808 --> 00:00:10.165
Start the slideshow to present the generated deck.

00:00:10.165 --> 00:00:13.309
Move to the next slide and inspect the explanation.

00:00:13.309 --> 00:00:15.839
Inspect the PDF and PowerPoint download options.

00:00:15.839 --> 00:00:18.147
Select a generated slide to inspect it at a larger size.

00:00:18.147 --> 00:00:20.648
Open revision mode for the selected slide.
